# CITATION.cff

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, pipeline, or methodology in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Subject-Independent Surface Electromyography Pattern Recognition for Prosthetic Hand Control: A Multi-Domain Signal Processing and Explainability Framework"
abstract: "A reproducible, modular machine learning pipeline and framework for surface electromyography (sEMG) signal processing, multi-domain feature engineering, subject-disjoint and Leave-One-Subject-Out (LOSO) cross-subject gesture classification, Explainable AI (SHAP, permutation importance, ablation) interpretation, and ONNX embedded deployment benchmarking using the NinaPro Database 2 (DB2) dataset."
